{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24948","headline":"李都尉重阳日得苏属国书 · 白行简","name":"李都尉重阳日得苏属国书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"降虏意何如，穷荒九月初。\n三秋异乡节，一纸故人书。\n对酒情无极，开缄思有余。\n感时空寂寞，怀旧几踌躇。\n鴈尽平沙迥，烟销大漠虚。\n登台南望处，掩泪对双鱼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白行简","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24948.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24948","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}